notes['achievement/familia/get'] = 'Wrapper 0x23637f4 accepts an empty request and caches for 30 seconds. Parsers 0x2363d9c/0x2363b30 read records 3001 personal page-login days, 3101 maximum members, 3102 current level and daily_achievements achievementId/currentParam. Actual local mystatus is_login visits are persisted once per UTC+9 day in the request/reply transaction; this is an explicit offline counting policy, not recovered publisher history. One real owner and original Familia level thresholds supply the other records. The daily tab resolves IDs through DomainFamiliaAchievementRepository (cell 0x1aee2b0), not ordinary UserAchievement daily missions: all nine original eventId-zero type301/401 rows and date windows are exported with archive hash provenance. Daily totals are zero or one actual observed member, never synthetic peers or unearned rewards. Boundary, retry/replay, rollback, changed event date, malformed/foreign state and restart pass isolated tests. Unknown historical personal progress rejects without erasure. Native isolated Adventure 5 on 2020-07-31 renders Daily 1/5, Members 2/5 and Familia membership 1/5 without a loading overlay or 1003; cold restart retains 2/5 without another login-day credit. Test save has synthetic story unlock and bank prerequisites, so this is not natural story progression proof. Cooperative reward delivery and other guild events remain incomplete.';
