notes['familia/skill/growth'] = 'Wrapper 0x1ac294c sends familiaId/familiaSkillId; native row producer 0x1eb1948 selects level 1 for unlock or current+1 for upgrade, filtered by authored availability at 0x1eb2a6c. Callback 0x1ac7364 resolves root familiaSkillId for the completion modal; 0x1ac76f8 refreshes numeric familiaSkillIds/skillPoint from the same reply. The actual local owner must have settled creation. Original cost debit, immutable level receipt and exact reply commit atomically in SQLite; already learned IDs cannot spend again after cache eviction or restart. All 315 levels/costs, date and skipped-level rejection, insufficient points, forced receipt/reply failure rollback and once-only retries pass desktop tests. MuMu seq 20191 unlocked Fire Damage Lv.1 for 3 points and seq 20192 upgraded Lv.2 for 3, rendered both completion popups and points 6 -> 3 -> 0, and disabled unaffordable confirmation without sending another request. Cold PID 14777 restored Lv.2/zero points without a crash or 1003. This fixture has synthetic prerequisites; natural contribution rewards, cooperative ownership, higher-level native screens, event-clock UI transitions and Familia battle damage effects remain unverified. Insufficient/invalid direct requests reject; non-success native business-result semantics are not yet recovered.';
