notes['gift/receive'] += ' New ordinary-item persistence SOURCE ONLY, NOT RUN/deployed. Exact operation248cbb8:248e09c separately applies receivedItems; stamina205000005 uses PlayerStamina2540e78, while other items resolve24e3a5c and gain0x50 with cumulative getter0xa0. The23 exported item-profile tables use permanent gift_item_claim(original item/amount/table/ID field/cumulative target) with operation/item and acquisition indexes. Repeated items aggregate, owned unique present/absent inventory validates, and shared reservations separate already-recorded gift/mission/PVE/Element/box/shop/Familia/character acquisitions. Original quantity, Iris credit, casino receipts, gift IDs, queue, sequence and reply commit together; no native inventory/signature pre-credit. ACK now requires actual saved ordinary acquisitions as well as received/deleted gift flags. Spending is valid; completed cumulative rewinds/deletion reject. Pending and cached gift replies validate quantities/mappings, and overlapping new awards detect unknown older gift baselines rather than reuse one increase. Missing/corrupt historical receipts remain queued with cancellation3000999, never guessed from flags or post-award inventory. New test_gift_items and updated test_gifts cover all23 present/absent classes, mixed rewards, owner/type/dateList/cap guards, flags-only rejection, split saves, spending, replay/session/restart/expiry, real mission/gift interleavings and two same-item gifts, receipt/queue/wallet/reply/ACK rollback and missing/corrupt-history preservation but are DEFERRED. Native grants/popups/flags/signatures/hot-cold/expiry and uncaptured interleavings remain unverified. Stamina SP proof, special units/equipment/costumes/raid/Lotto rewards and publisher subscription service remain incomplete; ordinary subscription-ticket inventory is not service restoration. See docs/gift-reward-contract.md; earlier native Iris evidence is not acceptance of these changes.';
